# Traditional Chinese catalog for the Jouzu CLI.
#
# Same message IDs, arguments, and argument types as `en/cli.ftl`. Terminology
# follows the Traditional Chinese glossary for this locale. The translation is
# an unreviewed draft: the safety, authentication, billing, privacy,
# destructive-operation, recovery, and accessibility text still needs a human
# reviewer who is not the Simplified Chinese reviewer. See the review record
# under docs/ for the checklist. Protected values (commands, paths, URLs, model
# and provider IDs, error codes, settings keys, and version strings) stay in
# their original form.

